{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2200,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 4400,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# 多元优化 · 从最优候选到价值变化\n\n统一约定：最大化问题的不等式写成 $g(x)\\le 0$，Lagrangian 取 $\\mathcal L=f-\\lambda^Tg-\\nu^Th$。读图时始终分开三件事：最优值是否取得、候选点从哪来、候选点何时真的最优。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2200,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 4400,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 1 · 无约束：存在、候选与局部/全局验证\n\n连续 + 紧致负责取得性；零梯度只生成开域内点候选；点上的 Hessian 负责局部分类；在整个凸域上的凹性才把局部最大升级为全局最大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2100,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n### [[极值定理|Extreme value theorem]]\n\nA continuous real-valued function on a nonempty compact domain attains a maximum and a minimum. This guarantees existence, not their locations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非空紧集上的连续实值函数取得最大值与最小值；定理保证存在，不负责定位。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1300,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[无约束一阶条件|Interior first-order condition]]\nAt a local extremum in the ambient interior, differentiability at that point forces $Df=0$. This necessary condition identifies candidates; it does not establish an extremum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**无约束一阶条件**：环境空间内点的局部极值，若在该点可微，必有 $Df=0$。这是必要的候选条件，不保证极值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -700,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hessian 局部极大判据|Hessian maximum test]]\nFor real scalar $f\\in C^2$ near an interior stationary point $a$, negative-definite $H_f(a)$ guarantees a strict local maximum; global maximality needs a separate argument.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hessian 局部极大判据**：实值函数在内点驻点附近为 $C^2$，且 Hessian 负定，便有严格局部极大；并不自动成为全局最大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半定Hessian无结论|Singular semidefinite Hessians]]\nAt an interior stationary point of a real $C^2$ function, singular semidefiniteness leaves classification incomplete. A nonzero positive-semidefinite Hessian still rules out a local maximum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半定Hessian无结论**：实值 $C^2$ 函数在内点驻点的奇异半定 Hessian 不能完成分类；但非零半正定仍排除局部极大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[凸优化全局性|Local and global optima]]\n\nOn a convex feasible set, a local maximum of a concave objective is global.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在凸可行集上，凹目标的每个局部最大点都是全局最大点。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[严格凹不保证解存在|Uniqueness and attainment]]\n\nOn a convex feasible set, strict concavity gives at most one maximizer; nonemptiness and attainment remain separate.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n凸可行集上，严格凹只给“若取得，则至多一个”；非空与取得性必须另证。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2200,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 4400,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 2 · 加入约束：可行方向、约束资格与 KKT 证书\n\n等式约束把移动限制在切空间；不等式还要分活动与松弛。LICQ 在候选点检查活动法向量，Slater 在凸问题中寻找严格可行点；两条路线不是同一个条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2100,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### [[Lagrange必要条件|Lagrange 必要条件]]\n\n等式约束梯度满秩时，目标梯度必须落在约束法向空间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2100,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### [[等边际原则|等边际原则]]\n\n预算等式下的经济学应用：内部最优使每元边际效用相等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1600,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### [[等式约束二阶条件|等式约束二阶条件]]\n\n只在可行切空间检查 Lagrangian Hessian；严格定号是充分而非必要。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2600,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### [[乘子不是精确罚金|乘子不是精确罚金]]\n\nLagrange 乘子是法向量系数；精确罚函数是需要另行证明阈值性质的新目标。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1600,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### [[严格最优不推系统非奇异|严格最优不推非奇异]]\n\n高阶项也能形成严格最优；比较静态所需 Jacobian 可逆性必须独立检查。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -800,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### [[KKT条件|KKT 条件]]\n\n原问题可行、对偶可行、驻点与互补松弛组成一个联立系统。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -800,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### [[互补松弛|互补松弛]]\n\n每条不等式的非负乘子与非负松弛量的乘积为零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -800,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### [[绑定不推正乘子|绑定不推正乘子]]\n\n约束取等号时乘子仍可为零；活动集不能按正乘子定义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[LICQ条件|LICQ]]\n\nAt a feasible point, LICQ requires the indexed gradients of all equalities and active inequalities to be linearly independent. Repeated or zero gradients must remain in the test.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n可行点处，全部等式与活动不等式梯度按约束索引检查线性无关；重复或零梯度都保留。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### [[Slater不等于LICQ|Slater ≠ LICQ]]\n\n一个查整个凸问题的严格可行点，一个查指定点的活动梯度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### [[Slater条件|Slater 条件]]\n\n在相对内部寻找严格满足适用凸不等式、精确满足仿射等式的点。它在凸问题中通过强对偶补上“最优 ⇒ KKT”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1470,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[LICQ保证乘子唯一|Multiplier uniqueness]]\n\nAt one fixed KKT point with the same constraint functions, LICQ makes the existing multiplier vector unique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同一 KKT 点、同一约束表示下，LICQ 使已有的乘子向量唯一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### [[LICQ不是KKT必要条件|LICQ 不是 KKT 必要条件]]\n\nLICQ 失败只让一条保证路线失效；具体问题仍可能有 KKT 乘子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[KKT必要性|KKT necessity]]\n\nA local optimum of a C¹ problem admits KKT multipliers under a suitable constraint qualification. LICQ is one sufficient qualification.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nC¹ 问题的局部最优，在适当约束资格下存在 KKT 乘子；LICQ 是一种充分资格。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### [[Slater强对偶|Slater 强对偶]]\n\n凸问题满足 Slater 且最优值有限时，强对偶成立并可取得最优乘子，从而给出最优 → KKT。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### [[KKT充分性|KKT 充分性]]\n\n凹目标 + 凸不等式 + 仿射等式使任何 KKT 点成为全局最大；该方向不需 Slater。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2300,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### [[严格凹不保证乘子唯一|严格凹不保证乘子唯一]]\n\n严格凹可使最优选择唯一；相关活动法向量仍允许多组乘子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2200,
      "y": 1700,
      "width": 4400,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 3 · 参数变化：最优选择怎么变，最优价值怎么变？\n\n值函数 $v(\\theta)$ 记录“最好能有多好”，最优解对应 $S(\\theta)$ 记录“哪些选择做到了”。IFT 追踪一条选择分支；Envelope 与 Danskin 直接追踪价值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1800,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### [[值函数|值函数]]\n\n$v(\\theta)$ 把参数映射为该问题能达到或逼近的最优目标值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "e100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1200,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### [[最优解对应|最优解对应]]\n\n$S(\\theta)$ 收集所有达到 $v(\\theta)$ 的可行选择；它可为空、单点或多值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1800,
      "y": 2350,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### [[包络定理|包络定理]]\n\n正则可微最优分支上，Lagrangian 驻点与约束全微分给 $dv/d\\theta=\\mathcal L_\\theta$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1200,
      "y": 2350,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### [[隐函数比较静态|隐函数比较静态]]\n\n活动制度固定且最优性系统 Jacobian 非奇异时，全微分方程以追踪选择分支。"
    },
    {
      "id": "e100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### [[Danskin定理|Danskin 定理]]\n\n选择集非空紧、目标连续且对参数凸可微、参数梯度联合连续时，价值的方向导数取当前最优解中最大的直接方向效应。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2350,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### [[优化器跳跃不推价值不可微|优化器跳跃 ⇏ 价值不可微]]\n\n选择路径跳跃时，价值可能仍可微，也可能有折点；必须直接检查 $v$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1800,
      "y": 2650,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### [[影子价格|影子价格]]\n\n影子价格是约束右端边际放宽时最优价值的一阶变化率；正则时由对应乘子表示。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1510,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "**从等式约束扩展到不等式约束**\n\nKKT 保留 Lagrange 驻点，并加入原问题可行性、对偶可行性与互补松弛。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[KKT充分性|Sufficient structure for KKT]]\n\nFor differentiable maximization on an open convex domain: a concave objective, convex inequalities $g_i\\le0$ and affine equalities make feasible KKT points globally optimal.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n开凸域上可微的最大化问题：凹目标、凸不等式 $g_i\\le0$ 与仿射等式构成充分结构，使可行 KKT 点全局最优。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-stationary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[驻点|Stationary points]]\nAt a differentiable interior point of a real scalar function, $Df=0$ defines stationarity. It means zero first-order change in every direction, not a zero function value or an optimum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**驻点**：实值函数在可微内点满足 $Df=0$，就称为驻点：各方向一阶变化为零；并非函数值为零，也不自动是极值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-global",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[凹函数驻点全局最优|Stationary points and global maxima]]\n\nFor a differentiable concave function on an open convex domain, zero gradient gives a global maximum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n开凸域上的可微凹函数：零梯度代入切平面上界，得到全局最大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-quasi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[拟凹驻点不保证最优|Quasiconcavity and stationary points]]\n\nOn the real line, x³ is quasiconcave and stationary at zero, but has no extremum there. Quasiconcavity alone cannot replace concavity in the stationary-point theorem.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nx³ 拟凹且在零点驻定，却无极值；驻点定理中的凹性不能直接改成拟凹性。"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
